      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEARTFELT NZ (10) has been racing well of late. Finished third at her latest appearance over 1730m at Bathurst, beaten 5.5 metres. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. Taking on a better line-up this time but she has the ability to mix it with them. AIR FORCE MAJOR (7) is a two-year-old colt from the Amanda Turnbull yard on debut. Won't spend a penny from this draw but luck may play a role on the bell lap. Was not far away in a recent trial. Any push in betting will add to the confidence. SWEET ESPRESSO NZ (8) is worth some thought after finishing sixth first-up over 1740m at Riverina Paceway last time out. TRANSPARENT HART (2) is next best and gets every chance from a favourable draw. Worth an each-way ticket.",
